00:06:44,944 --> 00:06:46,524
How to Make Governments Sign Things.

100
00:06:47,644 --> 00:06:48,144
Politicians

101
00:06:48,684 --> 00:06:49,244
move when they see voters demanding it and political cover to do it. Give them both.

102
00:06:49,244 --> 00:06:49,744
First, prove public demand.

103
00:06:50,464 --> 00:06:54,304
Get three point five percent of the population (two hundred and eighty million

104
00:06:54,304 --> 00:06:57,844
people) to say "yes" with verified identity.

105
00:06:58,864 --> 00:07:03,404
The three point five percent finding is not a magic law of treaty ratification.

106
00:07:03,964 --> 00:07:06,524
It is a coordination heuristic:

107
00:07:06,584 --> 00:07:11,564
the point where a cause stops looking like a niche moral hobby and starts

108
00:07:11,564 --> 00:07:15,184
looking like a voting bloc large enough to create career risk.

109
00:07:15,964 --> 00:07:17,014
That's not activism.

110
00:07:17,644 --> 00:07:18,334
That's a mandate.

111
00:07:19,724 --> 00:07:21,164
Second, prove it's safe.

112
00:07:22,224 --> 00:07:26,684
Peer-reviewed modeling showing every nation gains more in health savings

113
00:07:26,684 --> 00:07:29,004
than it loses in military spending.

114
00:07:29,964 --> 00:07:33,184
Politicians need cover the way vampires need darkness.

115
00:07:33,704 --> 00:07:37,324
Give them the numbers and they'll pretend it was their idea (the second

116
00:07:37,324 --> 00:07:41,084
most reliable pattern in your political history, after blaming the previous

117
00:07:41,084 --> 00:07:41,784
administration).

118
