366
00:20:56,044 --> 00:20:58,274
One hundred and fifty thousand deaths a day continue.

367
00:20:59,204 --> 00:21:02,354
You remain rich, mortal, and forgettable.

368
00:21:02,584 --> 00:21:05,204
